<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00</p>
<p>higher.  Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   230-260 lbs    60.00</p>
<p>US  2-3   260-280 lbs    59.00-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. 0.50-1.50 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
